                <h5 class="pt-12 text-left"style="font-size:18px">Equipment Supply</h5>
                <p class='text-justify'>We provide a wide range of industrial and energy-related equipment sourced from globally recognized manufacturers. With a focus on timely delivery and comprehensive support, we help clients maintain operational continuity with equipment that meets today’s technical and performance expectations.</p>
