                <h5 class="pt-12 text-left"style="font-size:18px">Trading</h5>
                <p class='text-justify'>Leveraging a strong global network, we specialize in the trade of industrial equipment, raw materials, and specialized components. We ensure seamless sourcing, compliance with international standards, and reliable logistics. Our trading services are designed to support your procurement strategy with transparency, value, and speed.</p>
