 </div>  
   



                <h5 class="pt-12 text-left"style="font-size:18px">Consulting services</h5>
                <p class='text-justify'>DETC offers precise consulting services in the field of polymers, composites, catalysts, addittives and adsorbents, and much more. Our professional team has diverse experience in chemical processes, equipment design, process automationand upgrdations.</p>
